---
description: Investigate useful owned evidence for the requested recovery.
args:
  goal: string
returns: CliContinuationInquiry
uses: [recoverCliRoute/selectCliDocket, recoverCliRoute/remote/reviewRemoteRoute, recoverCliRoute/remote/planCliContinuation]
---
Investigate the user’s saved invocation and the current authenticated gateway through the mounted remote-access codebase. Select the actual current docket rather than a similar archived label. Choose which further scope evidence is useful to the question. Keep unread gateway and continuation evidence null; absence of inspection does not mean identity mismatch. A returned native refusal is evidence to interpret, never a reason to switch to a similarly named workspace.
